abstract: >
  Lean 4 + Mathlib formalization of the Lutar Invariant (the Λ trust
  aggregator) and the audit-fiber, receipt and quorum theorems behind the SZL
  governance gate. Exactly eight formulas are locked-proven; the conditional
  Theorem U gives Λ uniqueness modulo audit-invariant equivalence under the
  Identifiability Assumptions; unconditional Λ uniqueness is Conjecture 1,
  which is open and machine-checked false as stated.
